  ".', landing_1010_faq_section_h2: '10×10 Pop Up Canopy Tent — FAQs', landing_1010_faq_section_intro_html: 'More buyer topics:": "\"., landing _ 1010 _ faq _ section _ h2: '10 × 10 Pop Up Canopy Tent - FAQ', landing _ 1010 _ faq _ section _ intro _ html: 'Flere køberemner:",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_10_q: 'Can sidewalls be customized separately from the canopy?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_10_a_html: 'Yes—sidewalls can be sized and printed to match your frame series and campaign. Separate replenishment is common; keep hook placements and zipper lines consistent by referencing the original BOM. Use": "\"., landing _ canopy _ anyers _ faq _ 10 _ q: 'Kan sidewalls tilpasses separat fra baldakin?', landing _ canopy _ anyers _ faq _ 10 _ a _ html: 'Ja - sidewalls kan dimensioneres og udskrives til at matche din frame serie og kampagne. Separat opfyldning er almindelig; holde krog placeringer og lynlås linjer konsekvent ved at henvise til den oprindelige BOM. Brug",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_1_q: 'What sizes are available for custom canopy tents?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_1_a_html: 'We supply common commercial footprints including 3×3 m, 3×4.5 m, and 3×6 m styles among others. Exact availability depends on frame series—use": "\"., landing _ canopy _ cananers _ faq _ 1 _ q:\" Hvilke størrelser er tilgængelige for brugerdefinerede baldakin telte? \", landing _ canopy _ cananers _ faq _ 1 _ a _ html:\" Vi leverer fælles kommercielle fodspor, herunder 3 × 3 m, 3 × 4,5 m, og 3 × 6 m stilarter blandt andre. Nøjagtig tilgængelighed afhænger af frame series - brug",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_3_q: 'Do you offer aluminum and steel frames?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_3_a_html: 'Yes. Aluminum suits frequent transport; steel can reduce unit cost for budget-led programs. Specify intended use when contacting us so we recommend the right": "\"., landing _ canopy _ cansers _ faq _ 3 _ q: 'Har du tilbud på aluminium og stål rammer?', landing _ canopy _ canopy _ cananers _ faq _ 3 _ a _ html: 'Ja. Aluminium passer til hyppig transport; stål kan reducere enhedsomkostningerne for budgetledede programmer. Angiv tilsigtet brug, når du kontakter os, så vi anbefaler den rigtige",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_6_q: 'Can sidewalls and accessories be included?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_6_a_html: 'Yes—sidewalls, weights, and related hardware can be quoted with your frame. Mention venue requirements (e.g., fire retardancy) when requesting": "\"., landing _ canopy _ anyers _ faq _ 6 _ q: 'Kan sidewalls og tilbehør være inkluderet?', landing _ canopy _ anyers _ faq _ 6 _ a _ html: 'Ja - sidewalls, vægte, og relateret hardware kan citeres med din ramme. Memory place krav (fx, brand retardancy), når du anmoder om",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_h2: 'Custom Canopy Tents — Frequently Asked Questions', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_intro_html: 'Quick answers for buyers; full detail in our": "\"., landing _ canopy _ anyers _ faq _ h2: 'Custom Canopy Tents - Hyppigt stillede spørgsmål', landing _ canopy _ anyers _ faq _ intro _ html: 'Quick svar til købere; fuld detaljer i vores",
  ".', landing_canopy_specs_3_h3: 'Canopy printing', landing_canopy_specs_3_html: 'Dye-sublimation or suitable fabric printing for vibrant logos on": "\". landing _ canopy _ specs _ 3 _ h3: 'Canopy printing', landing _ canopy _ specs _ 3 _ html: 'Dye- sublimering eller passende stof print til pulserende logoer på",
  ".', landing_canopy_specs_4_h3: 'Sidewalls & accessories', landing_canopy_specs_4_html: 'Optional sidewalls, half walls, rail skirts, and hardware-compatible weights—list add-ons in your RFQ for a single BOM.', landing_canopy_specs_5_h3: 'MOQ & lead time', landing_canopy_specs_5_html: 'Varies by print complexity and season; review": "\". landing _ canopy _ specs _ 4 _ h3: 'Sidewalls & accessories', landing _ canopy _ specs _ 4 _ html: 'Valgfri sidewalls, Half walls, skinneskørter, og hardware- kompatible vægte - list addons in your RFQ for a single BOM'., landing _ canopy _ specs _ 5 _ h3: 'MOQ & lead time' landing _ canopy _ specs _ 5 _ html: 'Varies efter print kompleksitet og sæson; gennemgang",
  ".', landing_canopy_type_3_h3: '3×6 custom canopy tents', landing_canopy_type_3_html: 'High-visibility footprints for sponsor lanes and outdoor retail—ideal when you need maximum graphic area on a single frame. See real-scene examples in the gallery above and": "\". landing _ canopy _ type _ 3 _ h3: '3 × 6 brugerdefinerede baldakin telte', landing _ canopy _ type _ 3 _ html: 'High- visibility fodspor til sponsor baner og udendørs detailhandel - ideel, når du har brug for maksimal grafisk område på en enkelt ramme. Se real-scene eksempler i galleriet ovenfor og",
  ".', landing_canopy_type_4_h3: 'Aluminum frame custom canopy tents', landing_canopy_type_4_html: 'Lightweight, corrosion-resistant frames for frequent touring; common on premium": "\"., landing _ canopy _ type _ 4 _ h3: 'Aluminium ramme brugerdefinerede baldakin telte', landing _ canopy _ type _ 4 _ html: 'Letvægt, korrosionsbestandige rammer for hyppig turning; fælles om præmie",
  ".', landing_canopy_type_5_h3: 'Steel frame pop up tents', landing_canopy_type_5_html: 'Cost-effective steel options for seasonal campaigns and rental fleets—specify frame material when you": "\"., landing _ canopy _ type _ 5 _ h3: 'Steel frame pop up telte', landing _ canopy _ type _ 5 _ html: 'Cost-effektive stål muligheder for sæsonbetonede kampagner og leje flåder - angive ramme materiale, når du",
  ".', landing_canopy_why_h2: 'Why Buyers Choose Our Custom Canopy Tents', landing_canopy_why_p1_html: '": "\"., landing _ canopy _ why _ h2: 'Why Buyers choose Our Custom Canopy Tents', landing _ canopy _ why _ p1 _ html: '",
