  "Tension Fabric Counter is an accessory product for display systems. Features the same tension fabric + quick-setup structure, but designed for reception counters, desks and booth furniture rather than backdrops. Available in illuminated and non-illuminated versions with multiple packaging protection. Enhanced visual appeal at night.": "Spænding Fabric Counter er et tilbehør produkt til displaysystemer. Har den samme spænding stof + quick-setup struktur, men designet til reception tællere, skriveborde og stand møbler snarere end backdrops. Fås i belyste og ikke-belyste versioner med flere emballage beskyttelse. Forbedret visuel appel om natten.",
