  "Trade show booths": "Trade show kabiner",
  "Trade show displays, counters, roll-up stands and kits.": "Trade show displays, tællere, roll-up stande og kits.",
  "Trade show fabric backdrops: straight, curved and modular tension systems.": "Trade show stof backdrops: lige, buede og modulære spændinger systemer.",
